<item>
            <title>[JGVT-25] Reports_Audit Trail: Experiment Audit Trail- Ad hoc report generation</title>
                <link>https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-25</link>
                <project id="46901" key="JGVT">TDS - Revvity Signals ELN</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;As a User,&lt;/b&gt; &lt;br/&gt;
I want to be able to view the experiment audit trail in a review friendly format to allow targeted GxP audit trail review at any time.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Development notes&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Data/Time - format DD-MMM-YYYY hh:mm:ss (&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;24h format)&lt;/font&gt; UTC+...&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Mockup ppt:&#160; &lt;a href=&quot;https://jnj.sharepoint.com/:p:/r/teams/NextGenELNforTDS/Shared%20Documents/General/1.%20Revvity/07.%20User%20Workshops/GxP%20Release%203.0.0/Audit%20Trail/Mock%20up%20Audit%20Trail%20report_Experiment.pptx?d=w13d749c3d18f40cf890c2bbab0291d89&amp;amp;csf=1&amp;amp;web=1&amp;amp;e=1XQ1cd&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;Mock up Audit Trail report_Experiment.pptx&lt;/a&gt;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Possible actions in the experiment history are:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;(non exhaustive list)&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Create (worksheet, table, ...)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Edit (worksheet, table, ...)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Edit properties&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Edit layout (changes to the order of content or pages)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Rename (if configuration allows renaming experiments)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Trash&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Restore&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Print Experiment&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Signing and closing actions&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Changed reviewers&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Copy&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Move&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Information items creation&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Information items edit&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Information items trash and restore&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Information items copy and paste&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Share&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Share privilege change&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Un-share&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Create link (object relationships)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Removed link&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Update link&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Recorded Reason for Change (worksheet fields)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Update definition (Tables)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Test notes&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Test all states of the experiment (active, in-review, closed,...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;For testing GxP-GMP General&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
